# Nu Disco, adapted from the VS Code theme by dbanksdesign (MIT):
# https://github.com/dbanksdesign/nu-disco-vscode-theme
# Colors come from its tokens/core.json5 and tokens/dark/*. Translucent
# colors are flattened onto the background, since Ghostty palettes have no
# alpha. Normal ANSI colors use the theme's saturated "light" tones and bright
# ones its pastel "lighter" tones, so terminal output matches the editor's look.
